  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <lg xml:id="TolC084">
          <l>ciṉainilaik kiḷavik kaiyuṅ kaṇṇum</l>
	        <l>viṉainilai yokku meṉmaṉār pulavar.</l>
        </lg>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Iḷampūraṇar</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Namaccivāya Mutaliyār</persName> 1931, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZMelJhy.TVA_BOK_0007521/page/68/mode/1up">68</ref>.</p>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <head>Cēṉāvaraiyar</head>
        <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Ci. Vai. Tamōtarampiḷḷai</persName> 1868, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/tolkppiyamcollat00unse/page/n90/mode/1up">87</ref>–<ref target="https://archive.org/details/tolkppiyamcollat00unse/page/n91/mode/1up">88</ref>.</p>
      <p>i-ḷ. ciṉaimēṉiṟkuñcolliṟku iraṇṭāvatum ēḻāvatum viṉainilaikkaṇ okkumeṉṟu colluvar pulavar. e-ṟu.</p> 
      <p>u-m.</p> 
      <lg xml:id="TolC085-Cena-cit1">
      <l>kōṭṭaikkuṟaittāṉ;</l> 
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC085-Cena-cit2">
      <l>kōṭṭiṉkaṭkuṟaittāṉ</l> 
      </lg>
      <p>eṉa varum.</p>
      <p>viṉaikkuṟippai nīkkutaṟku viṇaiyeṉṟār.</p>
      <p>viṉainilaiyokkumeṉṟārēṉum, pukaḻtal paḻittaleṉṉuntoṭakkattaṉavoḻittu mayaṅkutaṟkēṟkum aṟuttal kuṟaittaṉmutalāyiṉa viṉaiyē koḷḷappaṭum.</p>
      <p>iraṇṭāvataṉporuṭkaṇ eḻāvatu ceṉṟatāyiṉum, ciṟuvaraviṟṟaṉṟi iraṉṭāvatupōla eḻāvatu vaḻakkiṉ kaṭpayiṉṟu varutaliṉ, okkumeṉṟār; atu kāraṇattāl, 
        karumamallāccārccikkuñ ciṉaikkiḷavikkum eḻāvatu urimaiyuṭaitteṉa uṭaṉkūṟātu, vēṟu kūṟiṉāreṉpatu.</p> 
    </body>
  </text>
